cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GranImpact in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "GranImpact: DEM simulator for granular impact craters"
abstract: >-
  Discrete Element Method simulator for impact craters in granular media, built as a
  layered C++17 core with pluggable compute backends (serial today; OpenMP and CUDA
  as interfaces). Includes bed/projectile generation, Hertz-Mindlin contact physics,
  Velocity Verlet integration, morphological crater analysis, CSV/VTK outputs and a
  Python post-processing package.
type: software
authors:
